 "remarks": "Heywood Heights is one of nicest complexes in Stamford.  It is situated very close to I-95, without the traffic noise. This unit is tucked in the back, You enter from Courtland and exit onto Hamilton. The unit is on the first level. Enter the foyer and the Galley Kitchen in on the left. This leads into a nice dining area with room for table and chairs.  Around the corner is the large Living Room with a wall of windows and sliders to the Patio. The view is peaceful with lush greenery. To the right the sidewalk leads to the beautiful pool area with the Club House for parties and meetings. Back inside there are two bedrooms, each with double closets.  Stackable Washer dryer in the unit.  On top of all this, a Garage is included. Plus there are many unmarked parking spots for guests. Low HOA fees, amazing for a complex this size with pool and grounds. Storage in the basement, as well as the hot water heater, which is fairly new.",
